'''Sheol''' is one of two floors following the {{s|Womb}}/{{s|Utero}}/{{s|Scarred Womb}}, the other being the {{s|Cathedral}}. After defeating {{e|Mom's Heart}}, depending on Isaac's deal chance, a {{r|Devil Room}} may spawn which will only contain a trapdoor leading down to Sheol. Other methods to enter the deal room such as {{P|Joker}} or {{e|Red Chest}}s will also work. Unlocking and defeating {{e|It Lives!}} will always spawn a trapdoor leading to Sheol, as well as a Beam of Light leading to the Cathedral. Additionally, Sheol can be accessed using {{i|We Need To Go Deeper!}} or {{p|Ehwaz}} from The Womb II.

Sheol has only one floor, featuring undead and dark/demonic enemies, and the boss is always {{e|Satan}}.

